			dependencies: ["3A4691ECB57299D6"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>Pixie-Enchanted Alloy</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, </grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>Annihilation Alloy</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>Improbability Steel</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Annihilation Alloy 是制造 </grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>Nightmare Sword</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 所需的材料，此外还需要基岩、exodium 方块和另外两把 Lethality 剑。</grad></shadow>"
