		{
			dependencies: ["26CB66594B824AE9"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>“赌徒之刃”</grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>击杀的每个敌人都会掉落一个。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你携带的每枚硬币都有 </grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>1 个百分点</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的几率触发头奖，而头奖会将你的伤害乘以 </grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>2.5 倍</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。触发头奖会消耗掉 </grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>1 到 7 枚</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>随机数量的硬币。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>软布</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和</grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>埃斯卡拉佩拉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>构成了其余的杂项物品。</grad></shadow>"
			]
