		{
			dependencies: ["69CAEEFF31FF3F3B"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>全套装备可提升 </grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>1.05倍</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>造成的伤害和一级 </grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>可爱度</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>该套装能力进入 </grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>战斗女仆之力</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，使你的可爱度翻倍，冷却时间为 </grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>45秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
