		{
			dependencies: ["186C7F821FAB3AC3"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>升级套装： </grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>1.10倍</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>造成的伤害和 </grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>两级</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可爱度。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>该套装能力可在30秒冷却后，为10秒内造成的伤害赋予</grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>分歧效果</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。分歧效果使每次攻击在短暂延迟后再次命中，第二次攻击的伤害上限为</grad><grad from=#A31419 to=#EBA0A0 f=0.8>20点伤害</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
